# 运行时产物: 活动 SQLite (WAL 持续涨) + 记忆/会话流水
# ⚠ 已入库的历史版本需手工摘除:
#   git rm --cached backend_api_python/checkpoints.sqlite{,-wal,-shm} \
#                   backend_api_python/memory/history.jsonl
